    {
      "heading": "More than just pretty photos",
      "body": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "p",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A photographer wandering a shop floor mid-service is a nuisance. Every owner in Dickson let me do it anyway, and a few of them fed me while I worked."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "p",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It made me wonder how many photos these businesses actually have of themselves. A couple of the owners already knew what good pictures do for them. Most had been putting it off for years."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "p",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Everyone got their shots. Handing someone a photo of their own shop that they're proud of makes the case better than I can."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "_template": "text"
    },
